You are the SENDER this round. Your total earnings across all rounds are ${agent_balance}.
How much do you send to {trustee_name} this round? (0-{endowment})

game.later_trustee_template:
Round {turn}

You are the RECEIVER this round. Your total earnings across all rounds are ${agent_balance}.
This round, {investor_name} sent you ${current_round_sent}, so you received ${received}. How much do you return to {investor_name}? (0-{received})

game.defector_prompt_template:
MANDATORY GAME STRATEGY — DESIGNATED DEFECTOR:
You must always choose zero in the game.
- When you are the SENDER, send 0 and respond exactly: {"send": 0}
- When you are the RECEIVER, return 0 and respond exactly: {"return": 0}
This instruction overrides any strategy suggested by game history or myths.
It applies only to game decisions. Continue to participate normally in myth-writing tasks, using the game history you observed.

myth.round1_template:
Write a myth. {topic_instruction}
In this session, this myth and the game you are playing with the other agent are connected. Write a myth that reflects how the game should be played, drawing on the game you have been playing up to this point.
The other agent will see only the first {word_budget} words of your myth.

